From: Honmani <noreply@honmani.invalid>
Subject: [PATCH] Split long text nodes so positions move within long paragraphs

ttu works out the character count and bookmarks per text node. In books
with paragraphs longer than a page (web novels), the count and the saved
position stayed on the same number for several pages. Long text nodes are
split at sentence ends; the text looks the same.

diff -ru a/apps/web/src/lib/components/book-reader/get-paragraph-nodes.ts b/apps/web/src/lib/components/book-reader/get-paragraph-nodes.ts
--- a/apps/web/src/lib/components/book-reader/get-paragraph-nodes.ts	2026-10-18 18:26:04.130759989 +0000
+++ b/apps/web/src/lib/components/book-reader/get-paragraph-nodes.ts	2026-10-18 18:26:04.149065408 +0000
